      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING ROYCE (3) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing second (34.56) at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Well-placed to take this out. MORAINE DYLAN (2) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at this track over 515m behind Paw Toronto (30.27) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Has never missed the frame from four starts from this draw, including a win. Should be about the money. DIVINE FEELINGS (4) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (30.52) in a Grade 5 FIN at The Meadows. Has a strong winning record here. Must be included in calculations. PAW HELION (1) surprised many when in the placings last start - deserves some thought.",
